.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
A Read-Copy-Update (RCU) wrapper around a Stream that provides lock-free read operations and exclusive write operations\&. Reader activity is tracked through an \fBEpoch\fP, while writers are synchronized using an \fBILock\fP\&. This ensures deterministic behavior in concurrent read/write scenarios without requiring external synchronization\&. 


.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fITStream\fP The underlying stream type being wrapped\&. Must derive from Stream\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
\fBType Constraints\fP
.TP
\fITStream\fP : \fIStream\fP
